    question: "What is const correctness, and why does the compiler treat a const member function differently from a non-const one?",
    slug: "4-what-is-const-correctness-and-why-does-the-compiler-treat-a-const-member-function-differently-from-a",
    categoryName: "C++ Fundamentals",
    categorySlug: "cpp-programming/cpp-fundamentals",
