    tags: ["c++", "runtime", "polymorphism", "actually", "work", "under", "typical", "compiler"],
    seoTitle: "How does runtime polymorphism actually work under a typical compiler implementation - what is a vtable and a vptr? | C++ Interview Question",
    seoDescription: "Interview-ready explanation and practical C++ example for: How does runtime polymorphism actually work under a typical compiler implementation - what is a vtable and a vptr?",
